{"seq":2,"slug":"rslib","title":"Rslib 库构建工具","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/build-toolchain/build-frameworks/rslib","wordCount":782,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"rslib-库构建工具\">Rslib 库构建工具</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Rslib 把 Rsbuild 的构建能力专门导向「库（npm package）构建」这一场景。库与应用的根本差异在于产物是给其他开发者引用的中间件：需要多格式输出（ESM + CJS + UMD）、需要外置 peerDependencies、必须生成 <code>.d.ts</code> 类型声明、通常不压缩。Rslib 的另一条主线是 bundle 与 bundleless 两种模式的取舍——前者合并为单文件、后者保留模块结构以利于 Tree-shaking。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"库构建的特殊需求\">库构建的特殊需求</h2><p>构建一个 npm 库与构建一个 Web 应用有着根本不同的需求。应用构建的目标是生成浏览器可运行的最终产物，而库构建需要生成其他开发者可引用的中间产物。这种差异体现在多个维度：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>应用构建</th>\n<th>库构建</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>输出格式</td>\n<td>单一格式（浏览器可执行）</td>\n<td>多格式（ESM + CJS + UMD）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>外部依赖</td>\n<td>全部打包</td>\n<td>peerDependencies 外置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>类型声明</td>\n<td>不需要</td>\n<td>必须生成 .d.ts</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>压缩</td>\n<td>必须</td>\n<td>通常不压缩（由消费者决定）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CSS 处理</td>\n<td>提取 + 压缩</td>\n<td>可选提取或注入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Tree-shaking</td>\n<td>生产优化</td>\n<td>必须保证可 shake</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Rslib 正是为这些库构建的特殊需求而设计的构建框架。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"rslib-概述\">Rslib 概述</h2><p>Rslib 基于 Rsbuild 构建，是 Rsbuild 生态中专门面向库开发者的工具。它自动处理了库构建中最繁琐的配置——双格式输出、外部依赖排除、类型声明生成、bundle 与 bundleless 模式选择。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph Rslib 架构&#10;        RSLIB[Rslib&lt;br/&gt;库构建框架]&#10;        RSBUILD[Rsbuild&lt;br/&gt;构建能力]&#10;        RSPACK[Rspack&lt;br/&gt;打包核心]&#10;        DTS[TypeScript&lt;br/&gt;声明生成]&#10;    end&#10;    RSLIB --&gt; RSBUILD&#10;    RSBUILD --&gt; RSPACK&#10;    RSLIB --&gt; DTS\">graph TB\n    subgraph Rslib 架构\n        RSLIB[Rslib&lt;br/&gt;库构建框架]\n        RSBUILD[Rsbuild&lt;br/&gt;构建能力]\n        RSPACK[Rspack&lt;br/&gt;打包核心]\n        DTS[TypeScript&lt;br/&gt;声明生成]\n    end\n    RSLIB --&gt; RSBUILD\n    RSBUILD --&gt; RSPACK\n    RSLIB --&gt; DTS</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"快速开始\">快速开始</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"npm create rslib@latest\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> create</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> rslib@latest</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"基础配置\">基础配置</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// rslib.config.ts&#10;import { defineConfig } from &#39;@rslib/core&#39;;&#10;&#10;export default defineConfig({&#10;  lib: [&#10;    {&#10;      format: &#39;esm&#39;,&#10;      syntax: &#39;es2021&#39;,&#10;      dts: true,&#10;    },&#10;    {&#10;      format: &#39;cjs&#39;,&#10;      syntax: &#39;es2021&#39;,&#10;    },&#10;  ],&#10;  source: {&#10;    entry: {&#10;      index: &#39;./src/index.ts&#39;,&#10;    },&#10;  },&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// rslib.config.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { defineConfig } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@rslib/core'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> defineConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  lib: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      format: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'esm'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      syntax: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'es2021'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      dts: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      format: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'cjs'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      syntax: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'es2021'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  source: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    entry: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      index: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'./src/index.ts'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"对应的-package-json\">对应的 package.json</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;name&quot;: &quot;my-library&quot;,&#10;  &quot;version&quot;: &quot;1.0.0&quot;,&#10;  &quot;type&quot;: &quot;module&quot;,&#10;  &quot;main&quot;: &quot;./dist/cjs/index.cjs&quot;,&#10;  &quot;module&quot;: &quot;./dist/esm/index.js&quot;,&#10;  &quot;types&quot;: &quot;./dist/esm/index.d.ts&quot;,&#10;  &quot;exports&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;.&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;types&quot;: &quot;./dist/esm/index.d.ts&quot;,&#10;      &quot;import&quot;: &quot;./dist/esm/index.js&quot;,&#10;      &quot;require&quot;: &quot;./dist/cjs/index.cjs&quot;&#10;    }&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;files&quot;: [&quot;dist&quot;],&#10;  &quot;scripts&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;build&quot;: &quot;rslib build&quot;,&#10;    &quot;dev&quot;: &quot;rslib build --watch&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"my-library\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"1.0.0\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"module\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"main\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./dist/cjs/index.cjs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"module\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./dist/esm/index.js\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"types\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./dist/esm/index.d.ts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"exports\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \".\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"types\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./dist/esm/index.d.ts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"import\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./dist/esm/index.js\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"require\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./dist/cjs/index.cjs\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"files\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"dist\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"scripts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"build\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"rslib build\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"dev\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"rslib build --watch\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"bundle-vs-bundleless-模式\">Bundle vs Bundleless 模式</h2><p>Rslib 支持两种构建模式，适用于不同场景：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    subgraph Bundle 模式&#10;        SRC1[src/index.ts&lt;br/&gt;src/utils.ts&lt;br/&gt;src/helpers.ts]&#10;        OUT1[dist/index.js&lt;br/&gt;单文件]&#10;        SRC1 --&gt;|合并| OUT1&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Bundleless 模式&#10;        SRC2[src/index.ts&lt;br/&gt;src/utils.ts&lt;br/&gt;src/helpers.ts]&#10;        OUT2[dist/index.js&lt;br/&gt;dist/utils.js&lt;br/&gt;dist/helpers.js]&#10;        SRC2 --&gt;|逐文件转换| OUT2&#10;    end\">flowchart TB\n    subgraph Bundle 模式\n        SRC1[src/index.ts&lt;br/&gt;src/utils.ts&lt;br/&gt;src/helpers.ts]\n        OUT1[dist/index.js&lt;br/&gt;单文件]\n        SRC1 --&gt;|合并| OUT1\n    end\n    subgraph Bundleless 模式\n        SRC2[src/index.ts&lt;br/&gt;src/utils.ts&lt;br/&gt;src/helpers.ts]\n        OUT2[dist/index.js&lt;br/&gt;dist/utils.js&lt;br/&gt;dist/helpers.js]\n        SRC2 --&gt;|逐文件转换| OUT2\n    end</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// rslib.config.ts&#10;export default defineConfig({&#10;  lib: [&#10;    {&#10;      format: &#39;esm&#39;,&#10;      bundle: false,&#10;      dts: { bundle: false },&#10;    },&#10;    {&#10;      format: &#39;cjs&#39;,&#10;      bundle: true,&#10;    },&#10;  ],&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// rslib.config.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> defineConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  lib: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      format: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'esm'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      bundle: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      dts: { bundle: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      format: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'cjs'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      bundle: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>缺点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Bundle</td>\n<td>工具库、独立组件</td>\n<td>单文件分发、无内部依赖泄露</td>\n<td>无法 Tree-shake 内部模块</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Bundleless</td>\n<td>UI 组件库、大型工具集</td>\n<td>消费者可精确 Tree-shake</td>\n<td>文件数量多</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"外部依赖处理\">外部依赖处理</h2><p>库构建的一个核心问题是决定哪些依赖应该被打包进产物，哪些应该作为外部依赖：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"export default defineConfig({&#10;  lib: [&#10;    {&#10;      format: &#39;esm&#39;,&#10;      autoExternal: {&#10;        dependencies: true,&#10;        peerDependencies: true,&#10;        devDependencies: true,&#10;      },&#10;    },&#10;  ],&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> defineConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  lib: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      format: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'esm'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      autoExternal: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        dependencies: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        peerDependencies: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        devDependencies: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#